# Pin the registry to the public npm registry for this repo (task: CI
# deploy failure). The machine-level npm config points at the internal
# SF-Express Artifactory mirror; any npm install here would otherwise
# write internal-only resolved URLs into package-lock.json, which
# breaks `npm ci` on the public GitHub Actions runners (commit d9f896c
# fixed exactly that by rewriting 352 URLs back to registry.npmjs.org).
# Public mirror is reachable from the corporate network too.
registry=https://registry.npmjs.org/
